    {
      "id": "UUyoGDYC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2537.170589983512,
      "y": 3548.4053238833135,
      "width": 2073.6,
      "height": 855.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1669864887,
      "version": 1131,
      "versionNonce": 1451811691,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786446010734,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 1:\nImprove the POC\n\n\n- BetterAuth: a library that handles\nauthentication in a project (back and front)\n- Script that creates a user and links an API key to it\n- Implement the API key middleware (headers, x-makisend-key)\n\n\n- A new route => POST /credentials\n- An authenticated user => submits their credentials (stored with AES)\n(SMTP_USER, PASSWORD, HOST, PORT, tls/ssl (to be handled) + a title (at least 4 characters) => an id\n- POST /send-email => - apikey\n                             - the email body\n                             - credential_id\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 1:\nImprove the POC\n\n\n- BetterAuth: a library that handles\nauthentication in a project (back and front)\n- Script that creates a user and links an API key to it\n- Implement the API key middleware (headers, x-makisend-key)\n\n\n- A new route => POST /credentials\n- An authenticated user => submits their credentials (stored with AES)\n(SMTP_USER, PASSWORD, HOST, PORT, tls/ssl (to be handled) + a title (at least 4 characters) => an id\n- POST /send-email => - apikey\n                             - the email body\n                             - credential_id\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ncbkA9iZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4294.849380779044,
      "y": 3541.5455131453673,
      "width": 885.6,
      "height": 495.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1774863609,
      "version": 1591,
      "versionNonce": 656684715,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786450422445,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 2:\nInngest\n\n- Set up a durable email-sending function\n- Serve it on Cloudflare\n- Define the event structure (event names\nand the type of data sent)\n- Add a healthcheck route\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 2:\nInngest\n\n- Set up a durable email-sending function\n- Serve it on Cloudflare\n- Define the event structure (event names\nand the type of data sent)\n- Add a healthcheck route\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ar-title",
      "x": 163,
      "y": 4900,
      "width": 1584.0,
      "height": 55.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#12100D",
