      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792742016394,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Code layout (pnpm workspace)\nbackend/  — Hono Worker, one folder per module:\n   controller (HTTP) → service (business) → repository (Drizzle) + dto (Zod)\n   send-email · templates · smtp-config · api-keys · email-logs\n   dashboard · idempotency · queue · workflows · transports · core\n   dependencies wired by hand (getters) in src/index.ts\nfrontend/ — Astro + React (shadcn/ui), built into frontend/dist",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ar-p-code",
      "originalText": "Code layout (pnpm workspace)\nbackend/  — Hono Worker, one folder per module:\n   controller (HTTP) → service (business) → repository (Drizzle) + dto (Zod)\n   send-email · templates · smtp-config · api-keys · email-logs\n   dashboard · idempotency · queue · workflows · transports · core\n   dependencies wired by hand (getters) in src/index.ts\nfrontend/ — Astro + React (shadcn/ui), built into frontend/dist",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
