      "updated": 1792742016394,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Delivery — GitHub Actions only\nCI (PRs and pushes to main / dev): lint · tsc · Vitest tests · frontend build\nDeploy, on pull request: Worker \"makisend-poc-preview\" with its own D1 and -preview queues\nDeploy, on push: remote D1 migrations, then wrangler deploy of the production Worker",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ar-p-cicd",
      "originalText": "Delivery — GitHub Actions only\nCI (PRs and pushes to main / dev): lint · tsc · Vitest tests · frontend build\nDeploy, on pull request: Worker \"makisend-poc-preview\" with its own D1 and -preview queues\nDeploy, on push: remote D1 migrations, then wrangler deploy of the production Worker",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
