      "seed": 1981368446,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 97306550,
      "index": "b2R",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792742016394,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Known limits\nAt least once: if D1 fails right after the SMTP send, a duplicate is possible.\nA single AES key, no rotation: changing it makes stored data unreadable.\nNo bounce, open or click tracking.\nSPF, DKIM, DMARC: configured at the SMTP provider, not in the code.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ar-p-limits",
      "originalText": "Known limits\nAt least once: if D1 fails right after the SMTP send, a duplicate is possible.\nA single AES key, no rotation: changing it makes stored data unreadable.\nNo bounce, open or click tracking.\nSPF, DKIM, DMARC: configured at the SMTP provider, not in the code.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
